  "update_count": 46,
  "description_snippet": "**VULNERABILITY DETAILS**   \nTypically, sites are restricted to a single download without further user interaction or acceptance. However, by opening a new window and redirecting it to about:srcdoc, a page can download an unlimited number of times. This is because about:srcdoc is rewritten to chrome"
